# ============================================================
# Brain Cluster — .gitignore
# 只追踪源码，忽略一切依赖、构建产物、运行时数据
# ============================================================

# === 运行时产物 ===
output/logs/
output/memory/
output/reports/
output/artifacts/
output/reviews/
