*.rar
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.bin
*.pth
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.onnx

# === 日志 ===
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

